# Assimilation Aegis: "When this Equipment enters, exile up to one target creature until this Equipment leaves the battlefield"
# (Bot2's Llanowar Elves) and "Whenever this Equipment becomes attached to a creature, for as long as it remains attached to
# it, that creature becomes a copy of a creature card exiled with this Equipment." Equip {2} on an Ornithopter makes it a
# Llanowar Elves (1/1 Druid Elf, CR 707.2). Equipping the creature it is already on does nothing (CR 701.3b), so it
# does not become attached again: one Attached event in all. The equip is not at its own end: the copy lasts while attached.

